## AC1 verification — gate verdict for this item's own `implement.py finish` (composed engine SHA + cache provenance)

Follow-up to the verification comment above, recording the verdict the AC explicitly requires. The driven child session exited on a transient provider error (`503 All providers exhausted`) immediately after `finish` succeeded, so the evidence comment was never posted from that session; the verdict is reproduced here from the run's report log `/tmp/wl-ms0mvtevk8-finish2.log`.

**Result:** `success: true` — *Implementation complete. Commit `e8d3fe16` pushed to `dev`.*

